    "body": "P4 · effort:medium · area:ui - maintainer's own ask for the next cut. The corner points are the part's real vertices and the circle/slot centres already reach the picker (PR #1405, opt-in feature points under #692) - the work is offering the same set in the WCS origin selection, one module following the existing feature-point pattern. Not the safety floor: the selection adds snap targets, it changes no posted output of a given document.\n",
